软件设计师（中级）下午题六（设计模式代码填空·Java） > T6.5 建造者（.stem:
组装电脑要按固定的步骤（先装 CPU，再装内存），但不同配置的零件不同，用建造者把「组装步骤」和「具体零件」分开。下面是用 Java 实现的建造者模式，类图如下，代码中只有一处空缺。

![类图](uml/pattern-builder.svg)

```java
class Computer {
    String cpu;
    String memory;
    public String toString() {
        return cpu + "/" + memory;
    }
}

abstract class Builder {
    protected Computer computer = new Computer();
    public abstract void buildCpu();
    public abstract void buildMemory();
    public Computer getResult() {
        return computer;
    }
}

class GamingBuilder ______ Builder {
    public void buildCpu() {
        computer.cpu = "i9";
    }
    public void buildMemory() {
        computer.memory = "32G";
    }
}

class OfficeBuilder extends Builder {
    public void buildCpu() {
        computer.cpu = "i3";
    }
    public void buildMemory() {
        computer.memory = "8G";
    }
}

class Director {
    private Builder builder;
    public Director(Builder builder) {
        this.builder = builder;
    }
    public Computer construct() {
        builder.buildCpu();
        builder.buildMemory();
        return builder.getResult();
    }
}
```

